{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StylebookNumberField",
  "tagName": "main",
  "$elements": [
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-number-field.json"
    }
  ],
  "state": {
    "opacity": "0.5"
  },
  "style": {
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
    "color": "var(--jx-fg)",
    "background": "var(--jx-bg)",
    "padding": "var(--jx-space-6)",
    "minHeight": "100vh",
    "& > h1": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-lg)",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-5)"
    },
    "& > h2": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "margin": "var(--jx-space-6) 0 var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& > p": {
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-dim)",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-5)"
    },
    "& [role=\"group\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "flex-start",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [role=\"group\"] > span": {
      "width": "80px",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-muted)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "h1",
      "textContent": "jx-number-field"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "A native number input. The platform supplies the spinbutton role, the announced value, the Arrow keys and the range; the element adds a ten-step Shift+Arrow, the two stepping buttons, and the difference between an empty value and a half-typed one."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "The events are the platform's own two names and nothing else. On the reader's own paths the native input and change bubble out of the control untouched, so a host reads event.target.valueAsNumber (NaN when the field is empty), event.target.validity and event.target.form; on the paths the element writes the value itself, the stepper buttons and Shift+Arrow, the same two names come from the element. Whether an empty value is a clear or a half-typed number is read off the element, as its badInput prop or the data-bad-input attribute it mirrors."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "role": "group",
        "aria-label": "Bound value"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "label": "Opacity",
            "min": "0",
            "max": "1",
            "step": "0.1",
            "stepper": true,
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/state/opacity"
            }
          },
          "onchange": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "=",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/opacity"
                },
                "value": {
                  "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "span",
          "textContent": "${state.opacity}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "role": "group",
        "aria-label": "Sizes"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "label": "Small",
            "size": "sm",
            "stepper": true,
            "value": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "label": "Medium",
            "stepper": true,
            "value": "2"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "label": "Large",
            "size": "lg",
            "stepper": true,
            "value": "3"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "role": "group",
        "aria-label": "Range and states"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "label": "Unbounded",
            "placeholder": "auto"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "label": "Off the step grid",
            "min": "0",
            "step": "0.3",
            "value": "0.5"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "label": "Disabled",
            "disabled": true,
            "stepper": true,
            "value": "12"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "h2",
      "textContent": "In a field row"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "The row, its label and its help sentence are recipes — native elements the theme sheet styles. The label names the control by id through labelledby, and the help sentence describes it the same way."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "jx-field-row",
        "data-prop": "columns"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "label",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "jx-field-label",
            "id": "sb-columns-label"
          },
          "textContent": "Columns"
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-number-field",
          "$props": {
            "labelledby": "sb-columns-label",
            "describedby": "sb-columns-help",
            "min": "1",
            "max": "12",
            "step": "1",
            "stepper": true,
            "value": "3"
          }
        },
        {
          "tagName": "p",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "jx-help-text",
            "id": "sb-columns-help"
          },
          "textContent": "Between 1 and 12. Hold Shift with an Arrow key to move ten at a time."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
